WEBVTT

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:01.240
photographers,

00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:05.056
they're looking for love
when they make photographs.

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:07.856
They're looking and looking
and finding love.

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:09.496
Growing up in North Philadelphia,

00:01:09.520 --> 00:01:13.376
I was surrounded by people
in my family and friends

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:14.936
who made photographs

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:18.936
and used the family camera
as a way of telling a story about life,

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:20.536
about life of joy,

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:25.296
about what it meant
to become a family in North Philadelphia.

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:28.376
So I spent most of my life
searching for pictures

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:31.816
that reflect on ideas
about black love, black joy